cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article in preferred-citation."
title: "csdid: Difference-in-Differences with Multiple Time Periods in Stata"
abstract: >-
  Stata package for group-time average treatment effects in
  difference-in-differences designs with staggered treatment timing, with
  doubly robust, outcome-regression and inverse-probability-weighted
  estimators, analytical and multiplier-bootstrap inference, aggregation and
  plotting.
type: software
version: 2.0.0
